cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pyxaf in research or audit work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "pyxaf: read and validate the Dutch Auditfile Financieel"
abstract: >-
  pyxaf is a Python library that reads and validates every iteration of the Dutch
  Auditfile Financieel (XML Auditfile Financieel 4.0, 3.2.1, 3.2, 3.1 and 3.0, CLAIR2 and
  the fixed-width ADF/CLAIR1 format) used to exchange general-ledger data with auditors and
  the Dutch tax authority. It detects the version by scoring signals, streams transactions
  in constant memory, keeps amounts as exact decimals, and reports data problems as graded,
  coded findings instead of refusing to load a file. Optional extras add XSD validation and
  exports to Arrow, polars, pandas and Parquet.
